   // CorNothInnkeeper (CorNothInnkeeper)
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_001 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Probably get a whole feather bed out of just one "
      "of those beasts, if what I hear is true. I think we don't have the "
      "luxury of time on this one, we march an army right through that human "
      "settlement and take the whole damned island with one move. Simple "
      "like, just like that.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_002 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I say hit them before they hit us, and hit them "
      "hard.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_003 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Go on, you. That's enough with your prying.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_004 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"A complete waste of space. A blemish on the face "
      "of this land. The entire city ought to be ~Iburned~I to the ground, "
      "and its inhabitants sent off into the wilderness to fend for "
      "themselves. Snobs and thieves, the lot of them.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_005 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"A nice place, I guess. If you like all the "
      "trappings of the royalty, or if you need the sort of artificial "
      "solace that a royal family provides. I don't need it, and I wouldn't "
      "live there. Not on a bet.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_006 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Is that where you hail from, stranger? What a "
      "joke. It's a cesspool of corruption and royal dogma.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_007 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Come back and see us soon, %s!\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_008 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Goodbye. Be careful now.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_009 = "~kD'Franco says, \"Good riddance. Humpf.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_010 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Cor Noth is a great town, loyal and patriotic to "
      "this kingdom. I think it has become a bit ~Itoo~I tolerant, if you "
      "know what I mean. An awful lot of foreigners here, most of them "
      "suspicious.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_011 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I love this town. Great place. I served in her "
      "forces, and would put my life forward to defend her without "
      "hesitation.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_012 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Mind your own business, you. Don't go disturbing "
      "honest folk in here with your sniveling.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_013 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Not a bad bunch of guys, if you enjoy conversation "
      "with impotent old men. Myself, I've got no time for it.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_014 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"You're full of questions, aren't you? Well, the "
      "Council is kind of a hold-over from the days when the King still "
      "ruled from Barloque. It's mostly a ceremonial position now, a kind of "
      "honorary entitlement.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_015 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Don't you go sticking your nose into my business, "
      "stranger. I don't know you from Konima.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_016 = "~kD'Franco says, \"An honorable man.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_017 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Akardius had better do something with the army. "
      "Kalior spent the better part of his years making it the best in the "
      "land.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_018 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I salute Kalior, even in death!\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_019 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I have heard stories, but only stories, of a power "
      "that was divided among three faces. The story goes that the power "
      "must find guardians in order to manifest itself to others. The story "
      "was old, and hardly anyone remembers it anymore. That is all I can "
      "tell you about it.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_020 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"There were three shooters.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_021 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Hail, %s! Come in and make yourself comfortable.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_022 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Hello! Welcome to the Cibilo Creek Inn.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_023 = "~kD'Franco says, \"Humpf.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_024 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Yea, I've seen him. That sorry excuse for a "
      "peddler has been in here. I hope he is not polluting the King's way "
      "with his presence again. That man needs to get a real job and stop "
      "forcing his wares on the weary travelers coming into town.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_025 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Traitors! The people of Jasper are traitors! Duke "
      "Akardius will take care of them, in good time...\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_026 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Stay away from Jasper, if you want my advice. That "
      "is a dangerous, deceptive place.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_027 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"What are you doing snooping around my inn? Be on "
      "your way, you.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_028 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Kill Zarcos, and people I know will reward you "
      "beyond your wildest fantasies.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_029 = \
      "~kD'Franco pretends you didn't say anything."
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_030 = "~kD'Franco ignores you."
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_031 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Watch your back in Marion. Royalists, you know.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_032 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Marion's a great town, if you like sitting around "
      "and watching the corn grow.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_033 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I don't like the looks of you, not the least "
      "little bit.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_034 = \
      "~kD'Franco shudders imperceptibly, \"Travelers have told me of the "
      "impudent words and deeds of this ~Ichild~I. I fear she has not told "
      "us the truth about her intentions.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_035 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I trust that our good Duke has plans to rid us of "
      "her threat. But in the name of learning, I worry about what effects "
      "that could have.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_036 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Even if she has gathered an army of capable "
      "fighters around her, which I do not really believe, I see no reason "
      "to worry about this child.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_037 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I must admit, the thought of all that power in her "
      "hands makes me quite nervous. I shudder to think what she could do "
      "with it. No doubt she could raze an entire city to the ground if she "
      "wanted to.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_038 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"What is it with you and this reckless child? Are "
      "you allied with her?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_039 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Word of her utterances has reached me, she is "
      "surely mad. Do not bring such madness into my house, lest it be "
      "contagious.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_040 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Forget it. I don't loan money out.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_041 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Not right now, %s. Perhaps later.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_042 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I wonder what the reason for Miriana's deeds is. "
      "Is it madness? Is it loneliness? Or could it be something we wish we "
      "had never guessed?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_043 = \
      "~kD'Franco shudders, \"These creatures that Miriana summons, perhaps "
      "they are her only friends? Wouldn't that be sad?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_044 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I don't have time to chat with you. Go and talk to "
      "Hester Gilk, she surely knows more than she admits, and perhaps she "
      "can tell you more about what you want to know.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_045 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"We should flood the warrens.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_046 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Those awful beasts should be exterminated. We "
      "tried, some years back, and I lost a lot of friends in the campaign. "
      "Slowed them down for a while, checked their advance but you can bet "
      "they'll be back in all their force and fury.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_047 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"What do you know about fighting orcs? Mind your "
      "own business.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_048 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"She should stand trial for her family's crimes "
      "against this country... that is, if she purports to be the "
      "representative of the Zarcos family. And if she isn't, why then she "
      "should get out of the palace and make an honest living like the rest "
      "of us.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_049 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Princess Kateriina Zarcos? I don't abide by her "
      "right to succession, or with the manner that her family has run this "
      "land into the ground over the last up-teen generations. That's right, "
      "~Igenerations~I.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_050 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"You've got to be kidding if you call that pathetic "
      "wench the heir to any throne.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_051 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Who are you poking around other peoples business "
      "like some kind of a Royal spy? Get out of here, you. I've got nothing "
      "to say to you.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_052 = "~kD'Franco says, \"Hang the rich.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_053 = \
      "~kThe room goes silent as %s mentions stunted dwarf."
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_054 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I don't know what happened... it was... hey, so I "
      "kind of lost it, okay? So I didn't know what to do, I couldn't make "
      "sense of anything, I panicked, okay? But you just don't know what "
      "you'll do at a moment like that until you're there, you know that? Do "
      "you know that?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_055 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"We were marching all day in the sun, climbing a "
      "rocky trail about two days south of Jasper. It was hot, and we hadn't "
      "seen a thing since we set out. Gotta give the orcs that, if they "
      "don't want you to see them then you won't see them. But they hit us "
      "just before sundown, in from both sides. Squeezed the scouts out, "
      "isolated them and slaughtered them to the man. They came in three "
      "waves, and by the end of an hour they were gone. We lost half the "
      "battalion, all Cor Noth men, about two hundred and twenty. We turned "
      "around that night, and dragged the wounded home back through the "
      "pass.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_056 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I'm not talking to you about that.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_057 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Tos is truly the capital of Meridian, and those "
      "that say differently can hang. I consider it to be the center of "
      "government, the seat of real power.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_058 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Cor Noth may be the best place to come for "
      "interesting conversation and ideas, but Tos is the business center of "
      "Meridian. I try to get over there as often as possible.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_059 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Don't you have anything better to do than disturb "
      "an honest businessman with your prattle? You annoy me.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_060 = "~kD'Franco says, \"Tova is an idiot.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_061 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"They are demons, warbeast slaves to the orcs when "
      "their armies march because of some ancient malevolent pact. I have "
      "seen it with my own eyes, in the battle at Tangee Bluff.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_speech_062 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Take your questions somewhere else.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_001 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Two words, and two words only. Civil war. Think "
      "about that.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_002 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Descendants of Konima or not, I say we jump on "
      "those militaristic people on the island with both feet. Wipe them "
      "out, and now. Or should we just wait around for them to do the same "
      "to us?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_003 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"The Royals are building support, secret-like. I'm "
      "not so young that I don't remember what it's like under a corrupt "
      "King's rule, and no way am I going back to that. They'll have to bury "
      "me first.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_004 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"The King lives yet, although he is in hiding. I "
      "don't know where he is or when he'll resurface, but you can bet he "
      "will. Crazy? Crazy like a fox, that old man.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_005 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I hear that there's a ~Isubstantial~I bounty for "
      "the loyal citizen who finds the old fox King Zarcos. That's not "
      "public knowledge now. I also suspect that if someone were to find him "
      "and he met with some kind of accident, that person would make some "
      "~Iinfluential~I friends indeed.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_006 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"The Princess is a ~Itraitor~I. Akardius needs to "
      "pull the troops together, as this land is in a state of emergency. "
      "Orc Warrens! Armies of bird-beast men! We need strong leadership, and "
      "as for the Princess? Throw her to the dogs!\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_007 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"After we take care of the orcs and the avar and "
      "the so-called human settlement at Ko'catan, something needs to be "
      "done about Jasper. They are a rebellious people, prone to violence "
      "and insubordination. Their history shows that quite clearly.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_008 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"That Yevitan up in Jasper is a man to watch. "
      "Scheming and clever, I know he's up to ~Isomething~I.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_009 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"The time when we needed a Royal Family for "
      "anything in this land is ~Iover~I. It's just sentimental nonsense. "
      "Nostalgia and schlock. Bah!\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_010 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I haven't been over to Konima's Island, and I'll "
      "tell you the truth I don't think I want to go. But I've seen some of "
      "the goods from those ~Ipeople~I and I'm here to say that their "
      "workmanship doesn't hold up to what we have here in Meridian.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_011 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Always great to see you.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_012 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Far'Nohl was a great man that turned to evil. He "
      "ruled this kingdom many years ago before his treachery met with an "
      "evil demise. But now his restless spirit wanders the earth again. He "
      "is evil incarnate.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_013 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I have heard from a traveler that there is a "
      "dictator that rules those island people. She claims to have seen "
      "him... she says that he is old and decrepit, but a direct descendant "
      "of Konima himself!\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_014 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Oh dear! Who shall raise the army to stop the "
      "orcs? We know where they are; but is there a force that can stop "
      "them?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_015 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"You know, with all the changes in the land, the "
      "new faction, Jonas leading the rebels, these attacks on the nodes, "
      "one starts to wonder just what lies ahead for us.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_016 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I pray that Kalior's military does not "
      "disintegrate in his absence. It will take a strong leader to fill "
      "those boots. Who is going to stop this civil unrest?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_017 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I lament at the fall of Kalior. He may have been "
      "the only one capable of stopping the threats imposed upon this land. "
      "Hail Kalior! May his memory live forever!\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_018 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"These island people, the so-called followers of "
      "Konima... who is to say that they're our allies? What do we really "
      "know about them? They are an unknown element, and we need to treat "
      "them accordingly. Keep them at an arm's length.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_019 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"These tokens that the Meridian Council carries are "
      "mysterious items indeed. I have even heard that those that carry such "
      "a token are immune to the effects of death!\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_020 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"To improve your abilities as a warrior, go and "
      "talk to Rook. His house is here in Cor Noth, right up the street. He "
      "is one of the finest swordsmen that ever lived, and is certainly the "
      "finest teaching his craft today. Even if his allegiances are... "
      "suspect, at best.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_021 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"To regain your strength from your journeys and "
      "from fighting, an inn is the best place to rest. You're safe here, "
      "and we'll see to all of your needs.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_022 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"When you're just beginning the path of the "
      "warrior, stick to fighting creatures that are not ~Itoo~I powerful. I "
      "started with giant rats and baby spiders before I went into the army "
      "and really learned the business of fighting.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_023 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Often the townspeople in Meridian need errands run "
      "for them, or favors. If you can help them out it is a good way to "
      "receive a reward of one type or another. We've all got to make a "
      "living.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_024 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Many of the townsfolk in these parts have spent "
      "some time adventuring themselves, and have ~Ispecial~I knowledge "
      "themselves that you may profit from. The trick is in getting on the "
      "right side of them to learn their minds.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_025 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"There is now a fifth temple where the dedicated "
      "may go to study in their school of magic, from my understanding. That "
      "is the Riija temple, thought for many, many years to be lost and now "
      "rumored to be on a remote and mysterious island.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_026 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I don't know about you, but I'm getting fed up "
      "with all this superfluous magic use in the towns. Some spellcaster "
      "makes it dark, and then it's too light from someone else's trickery, "
      "maces and apples lying all over the place... I won't stand for it in "
      "my place, and you can bet the Duke is looking into it. It's "
      "harassment, plain and simple.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_027 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"When business was good, everybody was happy. Duke "
      "Kalior kept the wheels turning and the money changing hands. He was "
      "and still is a great man.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_028 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Brigands and thieves running all over the land... "
      "what next? Someone has to keep those murdering, thieving swine in "
      "check. Thank Faren for the courage of those who do.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_029 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I have heard that at the heart of these orc "
      "warrens is a huge amount of treasure, should any party of adventurers "
      "be valiant and persistent enough to make it there.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_030 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Not all opinions are of equal value. Some opinions "
      "are better than other opinions. Since this is my establishment, my "
      "opinion is the best opinion available.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_031 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Check out the news globe there in the corner, "
      "there are some interesting posts.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_032 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"The Bards are a great addition to this town. "
      "Always helpful, full of information.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_033 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"These red sky days are a curious event. I stay "
      "inside the inn here when they occur, where it's safe.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_034 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Some strange reports coming from the mysterious "
      "island. They say there is a race of bird-like men there with a deadly "
      "magic all their own.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_035 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I served with Duke Kalior's Army when the call to "
      "duty came. Cor Noth Light Infantry, Third Battalion under General "
      "D'Accor. I was at Tangee Bluff, no doubt you've heard of the battle "
      "there.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_036 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Anyone can speak their mind freely in my inn. You "
      "are free to express yourself here, provided you use good manners.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_037 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I could tell you stories about the Third Orc "
      "Campaign that would make your hair stand on end... but I don't like "
      "to talk about it. I saw too much, I tell you, too much.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_038 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"I am proud to be from Cor Noth. Fourth generation, "
      "and my family has a long record of service and patriotism.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_039 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Business keeps this country up and on its feet.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_040 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Money. You may not like it, but you have got to "
      "have some.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_041 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"All are welcome at the Cibilo Creek Inn, and all "
      "may speak their minds freely. We only ask that you keep a civil "
      "tongue for the benefit of our other patrons.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_042 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Come in and make yourself comfortable. What is the "
      "news from outside these walls?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_043 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Can I get you anything?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_044 = "~kD'Franco says, \"What?\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_045 = "~kD'Franco says, \"Ouch.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_046 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Must have been something I ate.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_047 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Darned heartburn is acting up.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_048 = \
      "~kD'Franco belches loudly and says, \"Excuse me.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_049 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"An innkeeper couldn't ask for a better town to set "
      "up shop in than Cor Noth. Between the university here, and all the "
      "travelers passing through, this place is always busy. Cor Noth is the "
      "crossroads of Meridian, no doubt about it.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_050 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"It's nice to be alive, here and now.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_051 = "~kD'Franco says, \"Nice to have you here.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_052 = "~kD'Franco pointedly yawns."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_053 = "~kD'Franco absently picks his nose."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_054 = "~kD'Franco wipes his brow and scowls."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_055 = \
      "~kD'Franco just looks at you, shaking his head."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_056 = \
      "~kD'Franco doesn't let you out of his sight."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_057 = \
      "~kD'Franco wipes his hands on his shirt and scowls at you."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_058 = "~kD'Franco mumbles to himself distractedly."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_059 = "~kD'Franco eyes you and spits."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_060 = "~kD'Franco clears his throat noisily."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_061 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"Humpf. I think you should be going.\""
   cornothinnkeeper_random_062 = \
      "~kD'Franco bangs dishes around as he cleans up, clearly annoyed."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_063 = "~kD'Franco sneers at you."
   cornothinnkeeper_random_064 = \
      "~kD'Franco says, \"You're a liberal, aren't you!?!\""
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_avar = "avar"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_barloque = "barloque"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_bye = "bye"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_cor_noth = "cor noth"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_council = "council"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_duke = "duke"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_fate = "fate"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_grassy_knoll = "grassy knoll"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_hello = "hello"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_izzio = "izzio"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_jasper = "jasper"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_king = "king"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_marion = "marion"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_miriana = "miriana"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_money = "money"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_need_a_courier = "need a courier?"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_node_attack = "node attack"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_orc = "orc"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_princess = "princess"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_stunted_dwarf = "stunted dwarf"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_tangee_bluff = "tangee bluff"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_tos = "tos"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_tova = "tova"
   cornothinnkeeper_trigger_troll = "troll"

   // CorNothSergeant (Rook)
   cornothsergeant_speech_001 = \
      "~kRook says, \"They are very dangerous, from the tales I have heard. "
      "I understand that the Avar can field armies, as we can! I do not "
      "think that you will ever see such a force in these parts, though.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_002 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I wish I'd never left, curse the day that I first set "
      "foot in this dry place, but the choice was not mine to make, don't "
      "you see. In time we must all obey our masters. And as importantly, "
      "those that advise our masters.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_003 = \
      "~kRook says, \"'Tis not a fairer place in the world than the royal "
      "Barloque. By my life there is not.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_004 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Thou art unfit to bespeak the name at all, knave. Go "
      "on, be about your business.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_005 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Fare well to you, my friend.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_006 = "~kRook says, \"Good day.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_007 = "~kRook watches you leave, very carefully."
   cornothsergeant_speech_008 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I have not yet encountered a Cave Orc, though you can "
      "be sure that they are as formidable as their mountainous counterparts "
      "to the south of here.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_009 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Cor Noth is in a strong position strategically, in a "
      "flanking position for any attack on Barloque that might come from "
      "Tos, or the mountains beyond. It is no accident that I have chosen "
      "this place for my ~Itemporary~I exile.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_010 = \
      "~kRook says, \"It is a fair, provincial town. Suitable enough for my "
      "academy, though I must say it is dominated by bookworms and "
      "squidheads.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_011 = "~kRook says, \"Go out and see it, knave.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_012 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Old men. What position is there for a lame panel of "
      "toothless half-wits in our current situation? Take them for a long "
      "walk, and come back alone, I'd be happier for it.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_013 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Once respected, certainly, but my view is that it is "
      "time that they move to a strictly advisory role and are replaced with "
      "younger, more aggressive thinking citizens.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_014 = "~kRook says, \"Flee, fool. Scatter.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_015 = \
      "~kRook says, \"An honorable officer, and a veteran with an impeccable "
      "career. He is on the wrong side though, serving with the Duke's Army, "
      "and I fear that we may someday meet across the field from one "
      "another.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_016 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Most remarkable, if what one hears is true! You will "
      "not encounter Dragonfly on the Meridian mainland, however. They are "
      "confined to Konima's Island.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_017 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I guess I have lost the chance to kill the pig "
      "myself.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_018 = \
      "~kRook says, \"This Akardius makes the hairs on the back of my neck "
      "rise. Someone ought to watch him.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_019 = \
      "~kRook says, \"What a waste. All these years competing for the "
      "throne. Why couldn't he have died years ago and made Kateriina's "
      "rightful ascension to the throne easier?\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_020 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Come in. It is a pleasure to see you again.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_021 = "~kRook says, \"Good day, %s.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_022 = \
      "~kRook watches you, slowly running his fingertips back and forth "
      "across his upper lip."
   cornothsergeant_speech_023 = \
      "~kRook says, \"A thorn in the side of this kingdom since the "
      "beginning of time, the people of Jasper have launched more campaigns "
      "against the throne than all the orc hordes combined.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_024 = \
      "~kRook says, \"A rebellious place, and a tough people, natural "
      "irregulars. Fine soldiers.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_025 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I have no time for this talk.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_026 = \
      "~kRook snorts contemptuously, \"Humph, what next?  King Jonas?  HAH!  "
      "That blubbering buffoon couldn't lead an army of brain dead trolls, "
      "let alone his own faction.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_027 = \
      "~kRook says, \"He has been a little more tight-lipped. I've also "
      "heard he has been wandering a bit more frequently.... Wonder what "
      "he's up to.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_028 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Even now his forces gather, in anticipation of coming "
      "battle.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_029 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I have not yet seen this monster, for they live far "
      "off in the jungles on Konima's Island.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_030 = \
      "~kRook says, \"There is but one way to attack the Lupogg King, and "
      "that is with numbers. Send in different leads to engage him, and pull "
      "those warriors back when they become wounded.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_031 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The Royalists have many loyal allies in Marion. The "
      "rank and file of every King's Army throughout every war in this "
      "lands' history has marched from Marion under the banner of the Zarcos "
      "family. The people of Marion stand by the King even now.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_032 = \
      "~kRook says, \"A fine town. Ever loyal, ever valiant, ever strong.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_033 = "~kRook says, \"Bah.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_034 = "~kRook says, \"An utter fool.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_035 = "~kRook says, \"A loyal ally to the King.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_036 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Only the mightiest warrior should pit their skills "
      "against the Orc Pitboss in solo combat, for he is incomprehensibly "
      "fast and stronger than two men.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_037 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Only the mightiest warrior should pit their skills "
      "against the Orc Pitboss in solo combat, for he is incomprehensibly "
      "fast and stronger than two men.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_038 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The Orc Wizard is found in the caves and underground "
      "passages of the Orc Warrens. They possess powerful magic, but I "
      "cannot say their strength.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_039 = \
      "~kRook says, \"To this maiden I have pledged mine life, and now await "
      "the chance to hold my strength to the test. I know that she had to "
      "send me away, just as I know that the time will come when she shall "
      "require my loyal service again. I await that time, and practice my "
      "skills.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_040 = \
      "~kRook says, \"How now! What news of this fair lady do you bring?\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_041 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Thou hast not the honor to speak such a noble name "
      "without besmirching it by proxy. Leave mine sight, patch, ere I run "
      "you through the guts and leave you to die like the dog you are.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_042 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Do I think they are a threat?  Don't make me laugh, I "
      "mean their headquarters is located in a bar.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_043 = \
      "~kRook says, \"In truth this Regifan is not a threat to man or beast, "
      "he is a rodent with ideas. I have but little use for academics, "
      "intellectuals, and the like, for I have heard enough of their "
      "theories on why this land suffers.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_044 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I played when I was younger, of course... stand-off, "
      "in the academy and for Barloque. I cannot play any more, however, as "
      "those hooligans from Marion fractured my spine in a dirty tackle.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_045 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I have heard that the shadowbeast has the ability to "
      "darken the area around itself. I have never seen such a beast, but I "
      "know it to be a formidable opponent.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_046 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I take students on an as-necessary basis.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_047 = \
      "~kRook says, \"A den of iniquity. We will live to see Tos burned to "
      "the ground, sieged and put to the sword. You have my word as a "
      "gentleman on that.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_048 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The business center of Meridian. Need I say more? "
      "Naturally I don't have much occasion to travel there.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_049 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Moron. Go and bother someone else, or I'll have one of "
      "my understudies dispatch you.\""
   cornothsergeant_speech_050 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Ha ha ha ha ha! What's this? Where? Ultra what?\""
   cornothsergeant_random_001 = \
      "~kRook says, \"King Zarcos lives, but is in hiding somewhere in "
      "Barloque. The time is right for him to return.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_002 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I live by the code of honor and that of the blade. "
      "There is no question that cannot be resolved within these sacred "
      "laws.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_003 = \
      "~kRook is so clearly a little man with an over-active ego."
   cornothsergeant_random_004 = \
      "~kRook says, \"'Tis a swordsman that thou fancies thyself? Mayhap I "
      "could show thee some guidance in your discipline, if thou art "
      "practiced enough and ready to progress.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_005 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Dost thou work then with the battle axe, to master its "
      "finer points? I too have dedicated my life to the combative skills "
      "and their perfection, and now earn my fortunes by teaching what I "
      "can. When thou art ready to learn more skills, perhaps I will help "
      "thee for a price.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_006 = \
      "~kRook says, \"If thou art following the path of the archer, then "
      "thou hast come to the wrong place, for I know nothing of that weapon "
      "except that those that fight by bow do so without honor. If thou art "
      "following the path of the archer, then get thee gone to the company "
      "of rogues and ambushers, for that is who would use such a weapon.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_007 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Dost thou use the mace as thy weapon of preference? "
      "'Tis an honorable weapon, and deadly in the hands of one versed in "
      "its mastery.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_008 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Of the traditional weapons, I would take the long "
      "sword above all others. It is the mainstay of the King's Army, and as "
      "such I have spent the best of my life dedicated to the perfection of "
      "its art.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_009 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The ways of magic are the ways of priests, the weak, "
      "the blind. Forsooth the ways of magic are the ways of those without "
      "the mettle to fight with honor, and distinction.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_010 = \
      "~kRook says, \"For the enterprising traveler, there are often "
      "messages that must be carried back and forth between parties across "
      "the land. Thou will'st certainly gain favor and often profit by "
      "playing the envoy.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_011 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The short sword is an honorable weapon, the weapon of "
      "the ancient gladiators of Tos. It is no match for the long sword in "
      "its reach, but it is deadly close-in.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_012 = \
      "~kRook says, \"There will be trouble soon between the factions. "
      "Fighting trouble.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_013 = \
      "~kRook says, \"If you wish to improve your skills as a warrior, you "
      "must fight against opponents that are worthy, nay, even beyond your "
      "abilities.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_014 = \
      "~kRook says, \"You will not advance your abilities if you are not "
      "willing to take risks. If you want to grow stronger, you must face "
      "great danger, and be willing to take wounds.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_015 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Kateriina needs to take the throne now. All things "
      "point to it. She is of age, Kalior is no more, and that fledgling "
      "politician, Akardius, is not fit to rule.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_016 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Thou hast come seeking the finest master swordsman to "
      "ever grace this land, and thou stands now before him. What dost thou "
      "humbly ask?\""
   cornothsergeant_random_017 = \
      "~kRook says, \"There are some warriors that seek solace in the mighty "
      "Kraanan. They have developed spells, potions and wands in his "
      "powerful name... I feel certain that Kraanan himself is angered at "
      "these weaklings, and at their inability to wield a blade. A warrior "
      "hasn't time to pray in battle.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_018 = \
      "~kRook says, \"On what side dost thou stand, friend? Barloque or Tos? "
      "If thou com'st from the Duke's camp, why then state thy business and "
      "we shall see to it now. But if thou dost side with the Princess, why "
      "then thou art most welcome, and consider my house as your own.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_019 = \
      "~kRook says, \"If a man is not afraid to die, then it is of no avail "
      "to threaten him.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_020 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The ultimate honor for a warrior is to pick the time "
      "and the place of his own death.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_021 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Training, training, training. That is the way behind "
      "the greatest warriors, every one.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_022 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The shield is a useful tool, and if thou will fight "
      "with one, choose yours carefully.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_023 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The great yetis of the ice caves to the west are a "
      "challenge even to fighters of the most developed ability.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_024 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The orcs are powerful swordsmen, though certainly "
      "lacking in the subtlety that comes with study. But do not "
      "underestimate them. You may end up paying for that mistake with your "
      "life.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_025 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Yes, I am the greatest swordsman who has ever lived. "
      "The greatest.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_026 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Pick your battles carefully. You will retain your "
      "enemies forever, for the most powerful of them will never forgive, or "
      "forget.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_027 = \
      "~kRook says, \"You must never back down from ~Iany~I fight, against "
      "~Iany~I foe. Never concede, nor surrender an inch of ground. Even if "
      "you are killed, it will be with your pride.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_028 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Keep your wits sharp, and your strategy two steps "
      "before the strategy of your foe. Strategy and skill will prevail over "
      "even the most powerful enemy who fights with skill alone.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_029 = \
      "~kRook says, \"You stand before a master. Bow.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_030 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Gather together the ten most gifted sword fighters of "
      "the land, and send them at me in a single wave.  I will deliver to "
      "thee ten bodies, ten headless peasants, and would be without a "
      "scratch.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_031 = \
      "~kRook is a man with a legendary temper, with the reputation as the "
      "greatest duelist of the age."
   cornothsergeant_random_032 = \
      "~kRook has the mannerisms of a well-groomed military officer, "
      "although beneath his impeccable manners lies the temper of a gut-shot "
      "troll."
   cornothsergeant_random_033 = \
      "~kRook says, \"What can I do for you today?\""
   cornothsergeant_random_034 = \
      "~kRook taps a little rhythmic patter out with his fingers against the "
      "back of his left hand."
   cornothsergeant_random_035 = "~kRook eyes you coolly."
   cornothsergeant_random_036 = \
      "~kRook stands very, very straight and watches your every movement."
   cornothsergeant_random_037 = \
      "~kRook is possessed with a sense of grace and agility that is evident "
      "immediately to any in his presence."
   cornothsergeant_random_038 = \
      "~kStanding before this little man it isn't hard to see that his "
      "reputation as the deadliest swordsman alive is believable. His every "
      "move is careful, smooth."
   cornothsergeant_random_039 = \
      "~kRook says, \"If thou will dedicate thyself with equal ardor to the "
      "combative arts as thou dedicates thyself to meaningless prattle, you "
      "will surely be a giant.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_040 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The orc scimitar is an ungainly weapon, heavy and off "
      "balance. Certainly not the weapon for an officer, though it is quite "
      "fearsome in the hands of those practiced in the skill. There are "
      "those around that would be able to teach a warrior those skills. Not "
      "myself, mind you.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_041 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Look straight into the eyes of your enemy, as your "
      "battle approaches and when battle is engaged. Do not shift your gaze "
      "to their hands, their sword, or any distraction that they might "
      "encourage. The battle will be won or lost through their eyes.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_042 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The swordsman rules the day. Or swordswoman, for many "
      "of the finest warriors in this land are female, as I should know, for "
      "they all pass through these doors seeking the advice of the "
      "~Imaster~I.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_043 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I am to understand that there is a great teacher on "
      "the faraway land at Ko'catan who teaches the bow. A fantastic weapon "
      "for the hunting, but forsooth I cannot say that a warrior would use "
      "it with honor in the field of battle.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_044 = \
      "~kRook says, \"If thou might wish to dedicate thyself to the "
      "scimitar, then I have heard that there is a man in Jasper that might "
      "be persuaded to help thee with that. I have heard that there is a "
      "teacher there who has great skills at the orc weapon.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_045 = \
      "~kRook says, \"The future of this land is as a map is, where the "
      "mileposts will instead be swords. It is a map where the piled corpses "
      "of the enemies of the crown will lie as thick road lines to mark the "
      "passage of the valiant forces of the Princess Kateriina.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_046 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I am loyal to none save the crown and to the lineage "
      "of the Zarcos line, a family of most royal bearing. Their direct "
      "bloodline has ruled this fair land for two centuries and half "
      "another, a bloodline that now sustains in the rightful heiress "
      "Kateriina. No others will ever challenge this right by sword as long "
      "as I stand.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_047 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I have killed twenty-four men in duels alone. Do you "
      "think you live by honor? By chivalry? It is up to you how you want to "
      "live, and how you die. If you live with dignity and honor then death "
      "is of no consequence.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_048 = "~kRook seems easily offended."
   cornothsergeant_random_049 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Thy karma is much more profoundly affected when thou "
      "dost kill another person than when thou dost kill a beast.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_050 = \
      "~kRook says, \"A large foe like the Lupogg King should only be "
      "attacked in sufficient numbers to deal many blows, or thou art doomed "
      "indeed.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_051 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Keep this in mind: that when one is attacked with "
      "magic, the power of thine weapons and thine armor will protect thee "
      "if thy gear be strong enough.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_052 = "~kRook says, \"Leave me.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_053 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I haven't time for you. Leave this place.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_054 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Our conversation is over. Leave me now.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_055 = \
      "~kRook mumbles, \"Impudent upstart, power is so important to him now "
      "that he is determined to take others down with him.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_056 = "~kRook pointedly ignores you."
   cornothsergeant_random_057 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Get thee gone. I am weary from the burden of your "
      "company, and my patience grows thin.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_058 = \
      "~kRook says, \"I have no more time to waste with your like. Be gone.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_059 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Thou dost not want to anger me, be certain of that. "
      "Go, before you err beyond mine temper, knave.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_060 = \
      "~kRook says, \"Go back to your Duke and tell him to keep his servants "
      "about his own house, where they won't get hurt. If you stay here I "
      "cannot promise your safety, slave. Get thee along to thy mommy.\""
   cornothsergeant_random_061 = \
      "~kRook's eyes become narrow slits, as he watches you with calculated "
      "venom."
   cornothsergeant_random_062 = \
      "~kRook nods his head slowly, watching you move about the room."
   cornothsergeant_random_063 = "~kRook is fuming mad."
   cornothsergeant_trigger_avar = "avar"
   cornothsergeant_trigger_barloque = "barloque"
   cornothsergeant_trigger_bye = "bye"
