   // CorNothTailor (Hester Gilk)
   cornothtailor_speech_001 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Barloque is a, ah, a sort of a shell of a city, "
      "almost a perfect metaphor for the state of governmental affairs here "
      "in Meridian. Nothing left but the trappings of royalty. Some, ah, "
      "some pieces of decaying grandeur. So what.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_002 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"The sea is very beautiful at Barloque. I think "
      "the city itself is a bit, ah, a bit dry.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_003 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I don't have occasion to travel, ah, to "
      "Barloque with frequency.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_004 = "~kHester Gilk says, \"Good bye. Be careful.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_005 = "~kHester Gilk says, \"Ah yes, goodbye.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_006 = \
      "~kHester Gilk watches you briefly, and then goes back to her sewing."
   cornothtailor_speech_007 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Cor Noth is the city of my exile. Of all the "
      "cities in Meridian, I believe that Cor Noth is the most palatable, "
      "but it is not the home that I have left behind. I have much work to "
      "do here.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_008 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Yes, this is, ah, this is a lovely place, my "
      "new home. It has been very welcoming toward me. You could say that I "
      "am grateful.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_009 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Well, I haven't been here long enough to form a "
      "strong opinion one way or the other.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_010 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Change is overdue. Our current system of "
      "government is outdated and waning. And their plans to improve this "
      "state of affairs are worse than you can even imagine.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_011 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"The Council? I understand that they are, ah, "
      "very wise and venerable men.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_012 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Nonsense, what gives them the right to believe "
      "they could govern the people better than the people themselves. "
      "Arrogant players in a game they did not create themselves. They fear "
      "change, mark my words.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_013 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I send my thread away to be cut by others. My "
      "craft is weaving; the cutting I leave to someone else, someone better "
      "suited to it.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_014 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"D'Franco is surely abashed at the death of Duke "
      "Kalior.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_015 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"It appears that even without Kalior, his plans "
      "to earn the throne may still throw Meridian into civil war.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_016 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Which one? The dead or the living?\""
   cornothtailor_speech_017 = \
      "~kHester Gilk gives you a strange look, \"Hmm, and what do ~Iyou~I "
      "know about fate, dear child?\""
   cornothtailor_speech_018 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Who can say what lies beyond the borders of "
      "what we know. The great libraries do not have all the answers either. "
      "Can you even begin to imagine what we are not told in these stories?\""
   cornothtailor_speech_019 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"One must never forget that history is written "
      "by the victors and that memories are distorted by feelings.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_020 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Always remember that history is written by the "
      "victors. If the current gods were the victors, what tale do you think "
      "they would want to keep hidden?\""
   cornothtailor_speech_021 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Hello. Is there something I can show you?\""
   cornothtailor_speech_022 = "~kHester Gilk says, \"Yes, hello.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_023 = \
      "~kHester Gilk nods without looking up from her sewing."
   cornothtailor_speech_024 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"You could say that I have an, ah, an affinity "
      "for Jasper, and the people of Jasper. Like me, the people of Jasper "
      "have borne the abuses of power on their spirits, and on, ah, on their "
      "independence. You might also say that I am involved with their "
      "struggle, and with their future.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_025 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I have many recent friends in Jasper. The "
      "people there have many troubles to overcome, many hurdles.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_026 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I have many old friends in Jasper. The people "
      "there have many troubles, many hurdles to overcome.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_027 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I don't know anything about this place.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_028 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I understand that it is a quaint city, although "
      "I must admit that I have not yet visited the town. I am looking "
      "forward to that time.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_029 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"People often seem to become strange when they "
      "come to know themselves.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_030 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Poor thing, it simply isn't fair that she is "
      "abused like this for her beliefs.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_031 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"The yarn she spins was all tangled. Now she is "
      "only smoothing out the knots.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_032 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Why do you think the priestesses fear the child "
      "so? Think about it and then come back to me.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_033 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Have you looked into the reasons for her "
      "behavior? The answer might surprise you.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_034 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Those who are determined to change something "
      "are the ones who get the attention.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_035 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Would you learn more about the power or about "
      "her deeds? Both, otherwise I cannot help you further and teach you. "
      "Perhaps you should seek out the authorities in this field, they could "
      "tell you more.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_036 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"She is a fool, and, ah, and must step down in "
      "the face of progress. I fear, though, that she will continue to "
      "resist our evolution toward progress. Don't we have the right to "
      "self-determination? Yes, we do. There is no room for sentimentality "
      "or nostalgia in the present. Life is pressing.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_037 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Yes, the Princess Kateriina. A fascinating "
      "woman, I understand. Yes, the people seem most fond of her.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_038 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I think I have heard something about her.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_039 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I trust Solomon implicitly. He has been, ah, a "
      "good friend.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_040 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"When I first arrived in Meridian, of course I "
      "went to Tos. But I couldn't settle there, I will say that it is far "
      "too busy for me. Cor Noth is much more to my liking.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_041 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I have not been to Twitannia and honestly, I, "
      "ah, I would not care to go.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_042 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Is it not strange that the moment of her death, "
      "which seemed to most to be her most triumphant, was in truth her "
      "weakest?\""
   cornothtailor_speech_043 = \
      "~kHester Gilk smiles and you sense she is hiding something from you, "
      "\"Would you like to see some of my woven goods? One never knows what "
      "one might discover. Perhaps you will discover something about "
      "yourself that you did not yet know.\""
   cornothtailor_speech_044 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Yevitan is a very interesting man, ah, he has "
      "certainly survived a great deal. He is an enemy to be respected, and "
      "a powerful ally to his friends.\""
   cornothtailor_random_001 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Children often see the truth or the future in "
      "their dreams. Most people forget that as time goes by, though.\""
   cornothtailor_random_002 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Are you prepared for what is to come?\""
   cornothtailor_random_003 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"There are, ah, people that will help those in "
      "need and, ah, that have the resources to afford such help. People "
      "that I am connected with, that I trust regardless of their motives.\""
   cornothtailor_random_004 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Be especially careful in Tos. They have two "
      "dukes, one dead, one alive, both equally dangerous.\""
   cornothtailor_random_005 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"The Royalists too have their means... spies, "
      "soldiers, secrets. Beware the princess's followers, and be not taken "
      "in by her charm.\""
   cornothtailor_random_006 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Most of the business leaders in this land are "
      "in collaboration, attempting to establish an ideological stronghold "
      "to defend their interests. Do not believe whatever information you "
      "may receive to the contrary, for there is also an enormous amount of "
      "misinformation.\""
   cornothtailor_random_007 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"You must be very careful what you say to others "
      "about your political views in Meridian, especially in Tos. You never "
      "know where that information will, ah, will end up.\""
   cornothtailor_random_008 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"For a price, you can receive any sort of help "
      "that you might need, help with ~Iany~I circumstances.\""
   cornothtailor_random_009 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Please take all the time that you need to look, "
      "ah, look around the shop. We shall talk when you are done.\""
   cornothtailor_random_010 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"We look out for each other. I keep, ah, an eye "
      "out for you, and you keep an eye out, ah, out for me.\""
   cornothtailor_random_011 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"There seems to be quite a lot of, ah, "
      "excitement that has been stirred up between the factions of the Duke "
      "and the Princess. Seems to be very serious.\""
   cornothtailor_random_012 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"We must stand up for each other, the common "
      "people.\""
   cornothtailor_random_013 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"No one knows what is the origin of the famous "
      "tokens of the Councilors. That they are great sources of power, there "
      "can be no doubt, for I have heard that they are capable of "
      "teleporting themselves around!\""
   cornothtailor_random_014 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"This land does not need a strong King to get "
      "it, ah, back onto its feet, it needs a strong Queen. The men in this "
      "land have had their chances to straighten things out, and have "
      "continually failed.\""
   cornothtailor_random_015 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I understand that there is a lot of trouble in "
      "Tos after dark, that it is not safe to be on the streets near the "
      "graveyard. No one has yet explained why the dead rise in that city "
      "and attack the citizens.\""
   cornothtailor_random_016 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I have heard something about an ancient Dwarven "
      "Hall somewhere out in the wild lands. What do you suppose that is?\""
   cornothtailor_random_017 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I have heard that a large black market is "
      "springing up around that new green mineral from the Island of the "
      "Illusionist.\""
   cornothtailor_random_018 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Can I help you find some thing in particular? "
      "I've got something here, ah, I've... \""
   cornothtailor_random_019 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Have you heard why the blacksmith Fehr'loi Qan "
      "moved his shop from Tos to Barloque? Do you suppose it has anything "
      "to do with the forces of the Princess and the Royals building up a "
      "large, ah, large stockpile of weapons and armor?\""
   cornothtailor_random_020 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"You may judge for yourself the quality of my "
      "work, but if I may say so the clothing I have here is without "
      "parallel.\""
   cornothtailor_random_021 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Are you looking for a particular, ah, a "
      "particular style or color of garment?\""
   cornothtailor_random_022 = \
      "~kHester Gilk stitches adeptly at a silk blouse."
   cornothtailor_random_023 = \
      "~kHester Gilk seems to follow your progress around the shop while she "
      "returns to work on her sewing."
   cornothtailor_random_024 = \
      "~kYou see that the excellent reputation that this shop has earned is "
      "well deserved. It is exceedingly well-organized, tidy, and "
      "comfortable."
   cornothtailor_random_025 = \
      "~kHester Gilk ties a neat knot at the end of a stitch and nips it off "
      "neatly with her teeth."
   cornothtailor_random_026 = \
      "~kHester Gilk prophesies, \"I can feel that the east wind brings "
      "change with it. How will you face the events to come?\""
   cornothtailor_random_027 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"There is more. It is said that Joguer has been "
      "making regular trips to Tos, where each time he makes huge deposits "
      "in the bank. Yes, ah, very large sums. And this is told to me "
      "directly from a person who has heard it from Skivlat, the banker. "
      "That makes it as good as true.\""
   cornothtailor_random_028 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Caramo has much more influence over the office "
      "of the Justicar than you might imagine. In fact, she not only counts "
      "the votes, but is responsible for implementing the Justicar's "
      "decisions. That is, ah, however she interprets them to be.\""
   cornothtailor_random_029 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"There has been quite a bit of talk about "
      "Frisconar lately. Have you heard? It seems that he has been connected "
      "with the recent rise in the dubious activities of the Necromancers! "
      "Fantastic! What do you suppose his motives would be, ah, if it were "
      "true, that is.\""
   cornothtailor_random_030 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Have you heard any new news of the affair "
      "between Herbutte and the Princess?\""
   cornothtailor_random_031 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"I have heard that Frular and Rook are going "
      "into, ah, business together. I have heard that they are raising an "
      "army, with Frular's funds and, ah, Rook's expertise.\""
   cornothtailor_random_032 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"Word is out that Madelia has become the "
      "Princess's closest confidante. Who knows what effect this will have "
      "on court politics?\""
   cornothtailor_random_033 = \
      "~kHester Gilk says, \"The rumors continue that Akardius and Alzahakar "
      "keep the deal made with Kalior, and are now conspiring together for "
      "the throne. They are surely a force if this is true.\""
   cornothtailor_random_034 = \
      "~kYou get the feeling that Hester Gilk is pointedly ignoring you."
   cornothtailor_random_035 = \
      "~kThere is something about this shop that makes you decidedly "
      "~Iuncomfortable~I."
   cornothtailor_random_036 = \
      "~kHester Gilk looks at you searchingly, as if peering into the depths "
      "of your soul."
